WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:02.480
See you later!

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.790
Bye!

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:09.030
And that's all the information 
I've secretly gathered about the UI.

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.030
<b>Mysterious Discovery Club</b>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.940
I see. Very interesting.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.620
Way to go, President!

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:14.910
Not enough...

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:16.860
Only the Mysterious Discovery Club

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:21.170
can explain this mysterious case 
the students are gossiping about!

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:24.240
Let's improve the visibility of 
the Mysterious Discovery Club

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:27.000
devoted to discovering the 
mysteries of the world!

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:28.630
It's not enough...

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.000
What's wrong, Shibaraku?

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:31.850
You have an opinion, for a change?

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:32.590
Not enough?

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:34.590
What's not enough? Not enough data?

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.890
Is the information not credible enough?

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:39.770
Lay your candid opinions on me!

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:42.280
We don't have enough...

00:00:43.540 --> 00:00:45.300
female club members...

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:19.870
Did you switch shampoos?

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:21.700
I didn't!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:22.450
Liar!

00:02:22.550 --> 00:02:26.430
Dream Cohabitation

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:24.190
You definitely switched.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:26.430
Some female members

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:29.700
would cheer up this dilapidated club room.

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:32.140
That certainly is a candid opinion.

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:35.010
D-Do you think girls would bring snacks?

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:38.000
Senpai, I'll go buy some juice!

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:40.220
<i>I'll go buy some juice!</i>

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:43.010
<i>...some juice... some juice...</i>

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:44.340
<i>It'd be twice as fun...</i>

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:47.030
<i>No, ten times as fun as it is now...</i>

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.180
Tea's ready!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:47.010
Thanks.

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:49.530
<i>Should I</i>

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:51.810
<i>use these?</i>

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:57.650
<i>Those will allow you to use my magic freely.</i>

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:00.230
<i>If I use these,</i>

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:04.160
<i>I could make all those girls join our club.</i>

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.080
<i>And...</i>

00:03:06.430 --> 00:03:08.350
<i>I could even create paradise!</i>

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.000
Shiba...

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:12.810
I summon thee, Rurumo!

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:11.710
Shiba...

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:13.460
Hey, Shiba.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:15.830
What's wrong with you?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.560
I've been calling you, but you're 
just staring off into space.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.410
Oh, sorry.

00:03:20.410 --> 00:03:22.170
I was just thinking.

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:24.160
<i>That was close.</i>

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.970
<i>I almost used one.</i>

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:27.590
<i>These are my life.</i>

00:03:27.590 --> 00:03:30.270
<i>Be careful. If they run out, I'll die!</i>

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:31.980
<i>I'll never use them again!</i>

00:03:33.490 --> 00:03:36.740
Tokoda, you saved my life.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.350
What? You're creepy.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.530
Anyway, let's go.

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:41.280
Go where?

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:44.380
We're going to expose the identity of the UI.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.930
UI?

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:47.030
Yeah!

00:03:47.930 --> 00:03:52.870
I received word that a UI, 
an unidentified individual, is living here.

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:56.160
An old woman wearing black, huh...

00:03:57.990 --> 00:03:58.630
There!

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.100
There she is!

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.460
Sh-She's real.

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:04.260
W-Wow, she really lives here.

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:06.770
That's definitely the UI.

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:07.580
Get down.

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:12.010
Uh, I have no interest in that old lady at all.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.470
Can I go?

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.580
Hey! What are you doing?

00:04:15.430 --> 00:04:16.580
Fool!

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.050
What are you doing?

00:04:18.050 --> 00:04:21.490
Didn't we tell you in the club room to 
never make conspicuous movements?

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:22.880
That was close, Shiba!

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:25.450
If you make eye contact 
with her, she'll curse you.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:27.590
You're exaggerating...

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:30.730
Acting on your own can spell all of our deaths.

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:32.090
Be careful.

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:34.460
We're dealing with a UI here... A witch.

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:36.100
What? A witch?

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:39.920
Your UI's not an unidentified 
individual, but a witch?

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:43.800
Our attempt to summon a witch was successful.

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.210
<i>Rurumo!</i>

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.570
That witch looks younger than I expected.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:07.410
I mean, the UI.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:08.960
But seeing her up close...

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.200
Shh. Quiet.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.910
<i>What are you doing here, Rurumo?</i>

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:18.590
It's done.

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:19.420
Hot.

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:20.650
Hot.

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:21.880
Hot.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.580
<i>Use some chopsticks!</i>

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:25.470
Fool!

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:28.120
Don't make contact with her!

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:31.350
Our objective today is only to observe and record.

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:33.440
Uh, right. Sorry...

00:05:38.030 --> 00:05:38.810
More firewood.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.520
<i>You don't know what chopsticks are?!</i>

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:46.010
I'll save these for later.

00:05:46.010 --> 00:05:47.190
<i>Cardboard?</i>

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:48.410
<i>You don't have plates?!</i>

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:53.660
<i>Your mouth! Your mouth is dirty!</i>

00:05:56.860 --> 00:05:58.830
<i>She wiped her mouth with a leaf.</i>

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.050
<i>You may be a trainee, 
but you're still a witch!</i>

00:06:02.050 --> 00:06:05.260
<i>Why are you living in poverty, Rurumo?</i>

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:08.780
Why is a witch living in a tent?

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.260
Maybe it's for fun.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:11.960
She must be undercover.

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.460
<i>Why is she on Earth?</i>

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.270
<i>I'm leaving. Call me again.</i>

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:17.490
<i>Meaning,</i>

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:20.340
<i>she didn't return to the spirit world?</i>

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:24.280
<i>I haven't used any tickets since then.</i>

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:27.690
<i>If I didn't summon her,</i>

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:30.850
<i>did she come down to Earth 
for some other purpose?</i>

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:32.420
It's not dry yet.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:39.110
<i>But...</i>

00:06:40.560 --> 00:06:41.330
<i>She...</i>

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:44.870
<i>doesn't seem to be enjoying herself.</i>

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:49.430
It's not coming.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.220
Yeah.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.760
Did the cat just talk?

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.040
She was talking to herself.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:57.570
<i>He just said "it's not coming."</i>

00:06:57.570 --> 00:07:00.430
<i>Is she waiting for something?</i>

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:08.980
<i>She doesn't like frogs?!</i>

00:07:09.350 --> 00:07:11.480
<i>Is that supposed to be a surprised reaction?!</i>

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:14.990
She tripped.

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.950
<i>Nice support!</i>

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:24.550
Is it dry?

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:25.610
I'm going to change.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:28.840
<i>This is sudden.</i>

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:30.630
Thank you.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:42.360
<i>S-Seriously? Now? Here?</i>

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:45.310
This must be some kind of ritual!

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:49.540
We must record this!

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:52.510
<i>No, no, no, no! This is bad! Bad! Bad! Bad!</i>

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:53.960
Senpai!

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:56.740
I'll take over from here!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.240
I'm a man, too.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:00.070
I can't run away now.

00:08:00.070 --> 00:08:02.320
It's too dangerous! Please leave!

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.290
You guys, too!

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.030
What? No way.

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:06.560
We came this far.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:08.040
We'll see it through to the end.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:09.340
Oh, a UFO.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:10.040
What?

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.690
Let's go check that out! Okay?

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:18.250
What are you doing?

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:21.240
You intend to claim this historical 
discovery for yourself, don't you?

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:23.200
You're so difficult.

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:24.090
<i>No!</i>

00:08:24.630 --> 00:08:27.450
Something extraordinary is about to begin...

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.980
She may be trying to send a 
message to the demon king.

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.080
Watch closely, all of you.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.240
Yes, sir!

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:36.000
<i>Don't!</i>

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:37.350
<i>Don't look!</i>

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:41.400
<i>Rurumo's a lot more shy than most people!</i>

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:50.460
<i>Notice us, Rurumo!</i>

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:59.430
<b>Oooh!</b>

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:05.030
<i>Untie yourself, rope! Get off!</i>

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.410
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:08.710
<i>Crap! Crap!</i>

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.840
<i>If only I had power...</i>

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.060
<i>The tickets!</i>

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:19.370
<i>Magic activate!</i>

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.490
Rurumo!

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:24.120
Is it him?

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:25.820
Is it the magic power?

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:27.760
Paltas.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.380
What's going on?!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:38.250
As long as I'm doing this, 
I might as well go all-out!

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:40.030
Fall!

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:41.350
Ah, hot!

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:44.530
Dalpha.

00:09:58.060 --> 00:09:59.040
Let's go.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:08.650
What?

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.950
You were waiting for me to use a ticket?

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.200
Yes.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.670
Because I'm a trainee witch.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:16.300
You should wait at home.

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.870
Don't you have one in the spirit world?

00:10:17.870 --> 00:10:18.560
No.

00:10:18.560 --> 00:10:19.170
What?

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:21.990
Trainee witches cannot return to the spirit world

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:23.810
until they complete their training.

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.910
You should've said so sooner.

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:33.400
Okay!

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:35.900
Let's go.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.110
Go where?

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:42.070
A girl shouldn't live like that.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:50.960
<b>Day After Day

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:58.870
<i>Events commemorating the CD release were 
held in various locations to rousing success.</i>

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.150
<i>Next...</i>

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:05.590
<i>An unmanned blimp crashed in West Park 
just past three this afternoon.</i>

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.130
<i>The reason is still unknown, but fortunately,</i>

00:11:09.130 --> 00:11:11.440
<i>no one seems to have been 
injured in the accident.</i>

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:16.610
Don't just walk up to me!

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:19.920
Weren't you watching my movements just now?

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.500
I was being stealthy!

00:11:21.880 --> 00:11:24.490
Jeez... Learn to read the atmosphere!

00:11:24.510 --> 00:11:25.580
The atmosphere...

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:27.960
Not that.

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:30.790
I mean we're screwed if someone sees us.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:33.250
My mom and little brother are home...

00:11:34.440 --> 00:11:36.320
I thought I heard something...

00:11:36.320 --> 00:11:37.460
Welcome home, Kota.

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:39.810
I'm home.

00:11:41.690 --> 00:11:43.220
What was that?

00:11:45.030 --> 00:11:47.970
I-It's a penalty!

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:50.920
Lately, kids at school are wearing 
horns as a penalty for a game!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:54.600
<i>Stare...</i>

00:11:58.900 --> 00:11:59.970
I see.

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:02.390
Dinner's ready. Get changed and come eat.

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:08.640
In any case,

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:09.420
What's this?

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:10.780
we'll be in big trouble if anyone finds you.

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:10.780
She's naked.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:13.500
Make sure you keep a low profile.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:16.470
This place isn't nearly as comfortable as the park.

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:17.820
Don't complain.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.600
Is it because we're witches?

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:23.040
Well, yeah.

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:25.800
There's one more thing I should mention...

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:28.930
The problem is my mom.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.030
<i>Mom.</i>

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:33.530
<i>It's starting. </i>Kinya: Prince of the West<i> is on.</i>

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:38.530
<i>Oh, my. I love this drama 
because there's so much blood.</i>

00:12:40.600 --> 00:12:42.200
<i>By the way, Kota...</i>

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.870
<i>Recently, there are a lot of cases 
of people dragging girls around</i>

00:12:45.870 --> 00:12:48.710
<i>and forcing them into their rooms.</i>

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.950
<i>You're not doing that, are you?</i>

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:54.080
<i>No way! Why would you ask me that now?</i>

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:57.530
<i>Did you suspect me?!</i>

00:12:57.530 --> 00:12:59.540
<i>Well, one of the neighbors said...</i>

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:03.570
<i>Wait. What are the neighbors saying about me?</i>

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:06.040
<i>But if you really do that,</i>

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.140
<i>tell me honestly.</i>

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.200
<i>You're too close.</i>

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:10.620
<i>When you do...</i>

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:13.530
Her eyes are terrifying.

00:13:13.840 --> 00:13:16.790
I can't tell what she's thinking. It's terrifying.

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:19.290
That's one occult mom.

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:20.600
What's "occult"?

00:13:20.920 --> 00:13:23.240
Well, don't worry about it.

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:25.840
Just do something about her

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:27.740
with Rurumo's magic!

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:31.320
Let's burn through those tickets!

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:36.950
Each one of these represents my life!

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:40.510
I swore I'd never use another ticket...

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:41.990
Huh?

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:44.290
Is it me, or are there way less?

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:49.730
The more your power affects the world, 
the more tickets ya use.

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:50.880
Did I not tell ya that?

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:52.390
No one told me that!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:56.360
You should've told me sooner!
 They're my life!

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:58.010
What about your life?

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:02.540
It's all right.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:04.930
Only this time at night is dangerous.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:06.550
My mom works part-time,

00:14:06.550 --> 00:14:08.090
my dad's employed full-time,

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:10.700
and my brother's in elementary school.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:13.400
What should we do if we're 
about to be discovered?

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:14.660
If that happens,

00:14:15.300 --> 00:14:17.370
climb down that tree to get outside.

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:19.690
Don't worry about it.

00:14:19.690 --> 00:14:21.750
Just leave it to me!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.110
What is this?

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.970
We're gonna have a traffic safety workshop.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.660
I wonder what we're gonna do?

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:33.470
They'll teach you how to ride a bicycle.

00:14:33.770 --> 00:14:37.110
I'm in the middle of a game. 
I'm gonna eat upstairs.

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.980
<i>Stare...</i>

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.860
This is delicious!

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.070
<i>They were that hungry, huh?</i>

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:03.210
<i>Don't wake up. Please don't wake up.</i>

00:15:09.990 --> 00:15:11.560
The water's great.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:15.520
You idiot! I told you to 
keep your voice down, Chiro!

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:16.140
<i>Glance...</i>

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.410
How long are ya gonna stare, pervert?

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:28.680
Sorry! S-Sorry, I didn't mean to!

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:30.650
Idiot! Keep your voice down!

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:32.070
You'll wake your mom!

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:36.790
<i>Her skin was so white...</i>

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:46.200
<i>I just couldn't relax knowing</i>

00:15:46.200 --> 00:15:48.420
<i>that Rurumo was staying at my house, but...</i>

00:15:54.140 --> 00:15:55.570
<i>Stare...</i>

00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:56.890
It's gonna be a cold night.

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.170
<i>Stare...</i>

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:02.530
<i>Stare...</i>

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.490
I've got a test tomorrow.

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:05.350
<i>Stare...</i>

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:05.350
I'm gonna stay up all night.

00:16:07.430 --> 00:16:09.840
His mom sure is a good cook.

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:15.710
<i>Watching Rurumo gain more 
energy every day made me happy.</i>

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:19.660
<b>Kota</b>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.410
<b>Three Days Later</b>

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.120
This is paradise.

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:25.380
This is nothin' like livin' in a tent.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.800
Comin' here was the right choice.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:31.720
This reminds me of the past.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:33.270
The past?

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:35.800
Have ya hidden a witch in your room before?

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.420
No, just animals.

00:16:39.920 --> 00:16:44.890
I used to bring abandoned dogs 
and cats home when I was little.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:47.500
I couldn't just leave them.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.320
Really? That's surprisin'.

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.080
Kota!

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:55.860
Wh-What brings you here?

00:16:56.290 --> 00:16:57.740
I made some tea.

00:16:58.040 --> 00:17:01.180
<i>Stare... Stare... Stare...</i>

00:17:01.180 --> 00:17:04.050
Okay, that's enough! Would you go now?!

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:09.990
<i>Stare...</i>

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:11.950
That was close.

00:17:12.380 --> 00:17:14.300
You kept animals?

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.070
Huh?

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:17.520
Oh, you mean what I was saying before?

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:21.750
No, my parents wouldn't let me keep them.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:24.220
I always returned them to 
where I found them in tears.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:29.360
Will we be abandoned if your mom finds us, too?

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:33.410
Well, when that happens, 
ya can just use the tickets.

00:17:33.410 --> 00:17:37.110
W-Well, we'll see.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:51.000
<i>Keeping them secret is tiring.</i>

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:52.130
Shiba!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:54.960
Did you see this, Shiba-kun?

00:17:54.960 --> 00:17:57.690
Nishizawa Mami's cohabiting with someone!

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:01.120
I can't believe she's cohabiting with a man!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:03.030
She's got no taste in men!

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:04.920
What?!

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:05.920
What's gotten into you?

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:08.470
C-Cohabiting...

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:11.150
How do you define "cohabitation"?

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:14.130
It's when an unrelated man and woman

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:17.280
live together before marriage, of course.

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:21.030
<i>...live together, of course...</i>

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:23.240
<i>An unrelated</i>

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:25.550
<i>man and woman!</i>

00:18:26.090 --> 00:18:29.510
<i>Live together! Of course!</i>

00:18:29.890 --> 00:18:31.640
<i>I hadn't noticed!</i>

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:34.680
<i>I was so focused on keeping it 
a secret from my mom,</i>

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:36.790
<i>I didn't even think of it!</i>

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:39.620
<i>I...</i>

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:42.270
<i>I...</i>

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:45.480
<i>I just got home!</i>

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:43.510
<b>I</b>

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:44.010
<b>Just</b>

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:44.510
<b>Got</b>

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:45.470
<b>Home!</b>

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.150
Oh, welcome home.

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:49.740
<i>Without realizing it, for three days...</i>

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:52.440
<i>I've been cohabiting!</i>

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:56.180
I... I... I...

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:58.390
I'm home, Rurumo!

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:04.780
<i>She's asleep!</i>

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:07.580
<i>You're much too defenseless for a witch!</i>

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:10.400
<i>Rurumo, you shouldn't let your guard down!</i>

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.050
<i>...guard... down...</i>

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:19.600
<i>So this is cohabitation, huh?</i>

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:22.280
<i>Having a girl...</i>

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:24.610
<i>A girl waiting for you at home!</i>

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:25.630
<i>It's a miracle.</i>

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:28.220
<i>How happy. How eccentric.</i>

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:31.640
<i>I'm on such a high stage right now!</i>

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:33.750
<i>I'm flying!</i>

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:38.240
<i>Her face is so small.</i>

00:19:38.850 --> 00:19:40.670
<i>Her lashes are so long.</i>

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:43.820
<i>Her lips...</i>

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.150
I knew it.

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.350
Wait! It's not what it looks like!

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:15.050
Rurumo, tell her why you're here!

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:17.560
We met in the park,

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:19.080
and he brought me here.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:24.090
You brute!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:26.850
D-Damn it!

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:29.740
Go on! Shorten my life!

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.200
Magic activate.

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:34.730
Arbel.

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:44.460
Good morning, Rurumo-chan.

00:20:45.480 --> 00:20:48.480
Good... morning.

00:20:48.870 --> 00:20:53.940
I completely forgot that Kota's little sister 
who'd been staying with her uncle in New York

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:56.010
was coming home yesterday.

00:20:56.620 --> 00:20:57.180
Hey.

00:20:57.580 --> 00:21:01.730
She used a memory alteration spell
to make herself your little sister.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:04.110
Now ya don't hafta worry 
about bein' found out.

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:07.060
Good morning, Rurumo-oneechan.

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:08.820
Good morning.

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:10.570
Good morning, Seitaro.

00:21:10.990 --> 00:21:13.520
What's your problem?

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:16.190
<b>Dad and Mom</b>

00:21:16.190 --> 00:21:19.710
<b>Rurumo</b>

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:19.700
This is your room.

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:27.520
<b>Rurumo</b>

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:26.480
I've never had my own room before.

00:21:29.390 --> 00:21:31.880
The cohabitation I always dreamed of!

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:35.480
It still smells like Rurumo.

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.560
This guy really is an idiot...

00:23:20.970 --> 00:23:24.170
Ah, Senpai, wherefore art thou Senpai?

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:28.290
If you love mysteries so much, 
I'll learn to love mysteries, too!

00:23:28.940 --> 00:23:30.690
Spring is here!

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:33.260
The next episode is "Magical Girl Showdown."

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Next Episode: Magical Girl Showdown</b>

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:34.960
I look forward to it.
